# How to cite this software. GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository".
# Update version and date-released with each tagged release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. To cite the published data, credit TracEconomics and keep the notice in SOURCES.md."
type: software
title: TracEconomics
abstract: "An open, transparent tracker of the economy, built only on public data: an archive of the source statistics, a pipeline that rebuilds the official figures from their published parts, inflation by household group for Greece, and the website."
